, or SIP, invests a chosen amount at regular intervals. A lump-sum investment places an available amount into a scheme at one time."}],["$","p","These are methods of investing, not separate mutual fund products. The underlying scheme and its risks still matter.",{"className":"mt-4 leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"These are methods of investing, not separate mutual fund products. The underlying scheme and its risks still matter."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","When a SIP may be considered",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-bold","children":"When a SIP may be considered"}],[["$","p","A SIP can align naturally with monthly income and encourage regular investing. Because purchases happen on different dates, the investor buys more units when NAV is lower and fewer when it is higher. This does not eliminate market risk or assure a profit.",{"className":"mt-4 leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"A SIP can align naturally with monthly income and encourage regular investing. Because purchases happen on different dates, the investor buys more units when NAV is lower and fewer when it is higher. This does not eliminate market risk or assure a profit."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-3 pl-5 text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li","You invest from recurring income.",{"className":"list-disc pl-1 leading-7","children":"You invest from recurring income."}],["$","li","You prefer a regular and automated habit.",{"className":"list-disc pl-1 leading-7","children":"You prefer a regular and automated habit."}],["$","li","Your goal and investment horizon support continued contributions.",{"className":"list-disc pl-1 leading-7","children":"Your goal and investment horizon support continued contributions."}]]}]]}],"$L1d","$L1e","$L1f"]}],"$L20"]}]}],"$L21"]}]
